#include <chrono>
#include <thread>

void retryWithBackoff(std::function<bool()> action) {
    int delay = 1;
    while (true) {
        if (action()) return;
        std::this_thread::sleep_for(std::chrono::seconds(delay));
        delay *= 2; // Exponential backoff
    }
}
```
2. **Resource Management**: Here's a basic example of adaptive chunk size management. This code should be adapted to your specific needs and environment.
